WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:03,150
Stop shaking

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:04,950
Just because of the thickness of this wooden house and wooden door

3
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:06,550
When Zong Xiong comes, he has to hit him several times.

4
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:08,150
Not to mention a few wolves

5
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:16,060
Wild wolves are smarter than wild boars and understand teamwork

6
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,580
It's not safe to open the door and go out rashly

7
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:18,700
But the gun is too long

8
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,620
It's too close and you can't reach it from the vents.

9
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:21,860
Wait until they retreat far away

10
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:33,310
It's ridiculous for me to go out again

11
00:00:33,310 --> 00:01:03,940
Holding a gun with one hand is not something people do

12
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:15,290
Wolf skin can be sold for money

13
00:01:15,290 --> 00:01:16,850
Wolf bones can also be sold to dog owners

14
00:01:16,850 --> 00:01:19,480
This wolf meat is woody and fishy, and the chicken is infested with insects.

15
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,970
Can only throw it away

16
00:01:20,970 --> 00:01:33,610
Experience value 600

17
00:01:33,610 --> 00:01:35,250
Strengthening points 0

18
00:01:35,250 --> 00:01:37,730
It takes 100 experience points to redeem strengthening points

19
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:39,360
It's 600 o'clock

20
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:41,400
The contract with Xu Dashan’s horse costs 600 points.

21
00:01:41,400 --> 00:02:01,700
The road should be almost big enough so don't choose the first road.

22
00:02:01,700 --> 00:02:04,340
The first one can't bear to leave the road group and it's hard to raise, so let's go with the second one.

23
00:02:04,340 --> 00:02:14,520
It looks dumbfounded, just what I like. Don't worry.

24
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:16,320
Not to fight, but to make friends
